    "cp.rc_t": "From 1 January 2027: e-invoice for more supplies",
    "cp.rc_p": "Notification 04/2026-Central Tax (26 October 2026) extends e-invoicing from 1 January 2027 to supplies on which the buyer pays tax under reverse charge (for example a purchase from an unregistered supplier) and to import of services, for businesses above ₹5 crore. Read from the notification text on 17 November 2026; check the notification before you rely on it.",
